{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"yes\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"We included 18 patients with PD (Table S1) who exhibited severe motor fluctuations and varying deficits of gait and balance.\",\n    \"Four participants exhibited frequent episodes of freezing of gait, predominantly whilst turning.\",\n    \"Four patients exhibited episodes of freezing, which differed in their types and severity (duration and frequency of events).\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"We exploited this platform in 18 patients with Parkinson’s disease, which allowed us to demonstrate that the subthalamic nucleus encodes the initiation, termination, and vigor of leg muscle activation.\",\n    \"We included 18 patients with PD (Table S1) who exhibited severe motor fluctuations and varying deficits of gait and balance.\",\n    \"Four participants exhibited frequent episodes of freezing of gait, predominantly whilst turning.\",\n    \"Four patients exhibited episodes of freezing, which differed in their types and severity (duration and frequency of events).\",\n    \"20 patients with Parkinson’s disease were recruited for the study.\",\n    \"Overall, 17 patients were retained for analyses on the neurorobotic platform and 12 for gait experiments.\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"全文明确区分了研究总体样本与不同分析任务的子组样本。摘要和Results部分明确报告研究纳入18名患者；Results的“Decoding of freezing of gait”部分明确指出其中4名参与者出现频繁的冻结步态（FOG）事件，Figure 8图注也再次确认有4名患者出现冻结事件。因此，4人是FOG相关分析的子组人数，而不是整个研究的总体样本量。指控者对原文的理解有明确依据，judge_supported为yes。报告将样本量写为4并非完全没有原文依据，因为4确实是FOG分析涉及的患者人数；但如果将4直接作为整个研究的总体样本量，则遗漏了18人的总体纳入人数及其分析层级，构成关键限定条件的缺失，因此report_supported为partly，而不是yes或no。另需注意，Methods还说明研究最初招募20人（“20 patients ... were recruited”），最终不同分析的保留人数也不同：神经机器人平台分析为17人，步态实验为12人。这进一步说明必须区分研究招募人数、总体纳入人数和特定分析子组人数。仅凭论文全文无法独立核验报告表格是否确实没有标注子组层级，但报告所述的4人不能代表全文所报告的18人总体样本量。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "41ad8c53-f8af-4280-bac3-1035ac5da5d1", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T152019610524Z", "elapsed_seconds": 54.187, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T15:21:13.813150+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4698623bb0e801398e8ed680b4acea51cf641c940d9c56efc167a9a75ec7ee07", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T152019610524Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "30352b77f5c0253533942063f8ce71211a1e3f8fc0a3bbf8bea173eb9b2f2a29"}}}
